Error [E0972]: `gpu` isn't a field of `System`
  --> config.jet:1:43
    |
  1 | module m { system.s: { target: linux.x64, gpu: true } }
    |                                           ^^^
 Why: a `System` has a fixed set of fields: `target`, `packages`, `services`, `options`
 Fix: remove `gpu`, or use one of `target`, `packages`, `services`, `options`
